-- 原生体合成来源说明
L["Available at the Synthesis Forge after unlocking pet Protoform Synthesis through Dealic Understanding and the Protoform Synthesis quest."] = "透過「德利爾理解」與原生體合成任務解鎖寵物原生體合成後，可在合成熔爐製作。"
L["Underwater by Ancient Hopper on the Sepulcher island. Chapter 4 campaign access is required."] = "在聖墓島的遠古漏斗旁的水下，需要完成戰役第四章才能進入。"
L["Under the top platform with the Malfunctioned Constructor in the Plains of Actualization."] = "在實踐平原上，失靈建構體所在的高台下方。"
L["Atop a floating tree in the Untamed Verdure; requires flying or a displacement ability."] = "在蠻荒綠地的懸浮樹頂，需要飛行或位移能力。"
L["Hidden beneath foliage on a floating tree in the Path of Inception."] = "在起始之路的懸浮樹上，藏在樹葉之下。"
L["Inside the Mistaken Ovoid treasure; if previously looted, find it behind the Frazzled Poultrid Hen."] = "在「錯誤的卵」寶藏中；若已拾取過，可在憔悴的家禽母雞後方找到。"
L["In Rondure Alcove after Altonian Understanding and A Means to an End; use the jumping puzzle or a displacement ability."] = "在獲得「阿爾頓理解」與「終結之道」後前往環形壁龕，需完成跳跳謎題或使用位移能力。"
L["On a chain over the Dimensional Falls. Begin above it in the Untamed Verdure, then carefully jump down."] = "在次元瀑布上方的鎖鏈上。從蠻荒綠地的高處開始，小心跳下。"
L["Chance to be looted from Crystallized Echo of the First Song."] = "有幾率從「初歌的結晶回響」中開出。"
L["At the back of a shelf in the Lexical Grotto; use a displacement ability from the marked entrance."] = "在詞彙洞窟的架子深處，從標記入口使用位移能力抵達。"
L["Can drop from Lihuvim in the Sepulcher of the First Ones raid."] = "可由初誕者聖墓團隊副本的利許威姆掉落。"
L["Inside a torch-like structure in the Arrangement Index; fly, use a displacement ability, or glide from the Repository."] = "在編隊索引的火炬狀建築內，可飛行、使用位移能力或從寶庫滑翔抵達。"
L["Inside Locrian Esper: enter the first room, turn right twice, then look beneath the pile between rooms."] = "在洛克里安感知器內部：進入第一個房間後連續右轉兩次，查看兩房之間堆積物下方。"
L["Chance reward from completing the Cluck, Cluck, Boom daily quest."] = "完成「咯咯咯，砰」日常任務後有幾率獲得。"
L["Inside the Library Vault treasure; if previously looted, the schematic remains at the same spot."] = "在圖書館寶庫寶藏中；若已拾取過，圖紙仍留在原處。"
L["Loot the Grateful Boon treasure; if previously looted, the schematic appears at the same spot."] = "拾取「感恩之賜」寶藏；若已拾取過，圖紙會出現在同一地點。"
L["Chance from Tribute of the Enlightened Elders, the Patterns Within Patterns weekly cache."] = "有幾率從每週任務「模式中的模式」獎勵的「啟迪長者貢品」中開出。"
L["Inside Gravid Repose: take the right ramp; the schematic is in the structure at its top."] = "在孕育安息之地：走右側坡道，圖紙位於坡頂的建築內。"
L["Chance from a Pulp-Covered Relic treasure, which can spawn in several parts of Zereth Mortis."] = "有幾率從「漿糊覆蓋的遺物」寶藏中開出，該寶藏會在扎雷殁提斯多處刷新。"
L["In Sepulcher of the First Ones, loot it near a pillar in Halondrus' phase-two room after defeating Halondrus."] = "在初誕者聖墓中擊敗哈隆杜斯後，於其二階段房間內的柱子旁拾取。"
L["Inside a cage in the Arrangement Index; reach it from the broken pillar by flying or using a displacement ability."] = "在編隊索引的籠子裡，可從斷裂的柱子處飛行或使用位移能力抵達。"
L["Reward from A New Architect, the quest that unlocks Protoform Synthesis for mounts. Currently only granted to the first character on the account to unlock the system."] = "解鎖坐騎原生體合成的「新建築師」任務獎勵。目前僅帳號中第一個解鎖該系統的角色可獲得。"
L["Atop a tall pillar in the Plain of Actualization; requires flying or a displacement ability."] = "在實踐平原的高柱頂端，需要飛行或位移能力。"
L["Inside a ground-level vespoid hive in the Resonant Peaks."] = "在共鳴峰的地面層蜂巢內。"
L["By the Genesis Vestibule, atop the structure leading to the Genesis Alcove; climb from its left side."] = "在起源前廳旁、通往起源壁龕的建築頂部，從左側攀爬上去。"
L["Chance to drop from Accelerated Bufonid mobs in Zereth Mortis."] = "有幾率從扎雷殁提斯的加速蟾蜍怪掉落。"
L["Chance to drop from Maw-Frenzied Lupine inside the Choral Residium cave."] = "有幾率從合唱迴廊洞穴內的噬淵狂亂豺狼人掉落。"
L["Speak to Shade of Irik-tu at the back of Firim's cave while dead, in ghost form."] = "死亡後以靈魂形態與菲歷姆洞穴深處的伊里克圖之影對話。"
L["Chance to drop from Mawsworn Hulk in the Endless Sands."] = "有幾率從無盡沙海的淵誓巨獸掉落。"
L["Reward for the Cyphers of the First Ones achievement; check your mailbox after fully researching the Cypher tree."] = "完成「初誕者密文」成就的獎勵；研究完密文樹後請檢查郵箱。"
L["Inside the Forgotten Proto-Vault; reach the mountain using flying or the Frog'it world-quest frog."] = "在遺忘的原生體寶庫中，可用飛行或蛙刃世界任務的青蛙上山。"
L["Inside the Chamber of Shaping, on a bench-like structure behind the Dominated Architect."] = "在塑造之廳內，被支配的建築師後方的長椅狀結構上。"
L["Chance from Enlightened Broker Supplies, the Enlightened Paragon reputation cache."] = "有幾率從啟迪者商人補給（啟迪者典範聲望寶箱）中開出。"
L["Atop an arch on Antecedent Isle; use flying or a displacement ability to reach it."] = "在先驅之島的拱門頂端，需飛行或位移能力抵達。"
L["In the northeast end of Vigilant Guardian's room in Sepulcher of the First Ones, hanging from the decor."] = "在初誕者聖墓警戒衛士房間的東北端，懸掛在裝飾物上。"
L["Inside the Mawsworn Cache treasure; if previously looted, the schematic is at that location."] = "在淵誓寶箱寶藏內；若已拾取過，圖紙仍在原處。"
L["Inside a small Arrangement Index building, immediately to the right after entering."] = "在編隊索引的一座小建築內，進門後立刻右轉即可看到。"
L["Unlock Camber Alcove with Altonian Understanding and A Means to an End, then complete the Inert Prototype ring minigame."] = "用「阿爾頓理解」與「終結之道」解鎖凹室壁龕，再完成惰性原型體的圓環小遊戲。"
L["In the Resonant Peaks puzzles, on the Primus Locus level; flying or a displacement climb reaches it."] = "在共鳴峰解謎區域的原初基座層，可飛行或位移攀爬抵達。"
L["Drops from nearly every mob in Zereth Mortis. Fastest farm: the devourer portals in Genesis Fields; also from A New Architect and the weekly Patterns Within Patterns cache."] = "扎雷殁提斯幾乎所有怪物都會掉落。最快的刷法是起源平原的吞噬者傳送門；「新建築師」任務與每週寶箱也會給予。"
