L["Found in Avian Nest treasures in Zereth Mortis."] = "可在扎雷殁提斯的鳥巢寶藏中找到。"
L["Farm mechanical bird mobs, such as Enhanced Avian. Matching rares have a higher drop chance."] = "刷機械鳥類怪物，例如強化鳥類。同族稀有怪掉率更高。"
L["Farm hawk mobs, such as Garudeon, Tahkwitz, and Grasslands Raptora. Matching rares have a higher drop chance."] = "刷鷹類怪物，例如加魯迪恩、塔奎茲與草原猛禽。同族稀有怪掉率更高。"
L["Farm beetle mobs, such as Hadeon the Stonebreaker and Sand Matriarch Ileus. Matching rares have a higher drop chance."] = "刷甲蟲類怪物，例如碎石者哈東與沙之女主人伊勒烏斯。同族稀有怪掉率更高。"
L["Farm spider mobs, such as Mother Phestis and Tarachnid. Matching rares have a higher drop chance."] = "刷蜘蛛類怪物，例如菲斯提斯之母與蛛形怪。同族稀有怪掉率更高。"
L["Farm Automa core mobs, such as Destabilized Core and Adrift Core. Matching rares have a higher drop chance."] = "刷自動體核心怪，例如失穩核心與漂流核心。同族稀有怪掉率更高。"
