L["Farm wolf mobs, such as Vexis and Lupine Animate. Matching rares have a higher drop chance."] = "刷狼類怪物，例如維克西斯與狼形活體。同族稀有怪掉率更高。"
L["Protoform Repository, Arrangement Index, northeast Zereth Mortis."] = "原生體寶庫，位於扎雷殁提斯東北部的編隊索引。"
